{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2d98331f-0e35-85fc-94d1-eb99a76c3277",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T14:03:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:58:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Kevin, and peace be upon you. I hope you are having a good day and that your work is not too heavy today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no, it's fine so far. Thanks. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:59:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you are very kind. My name is Declan Lynch. I am calling, um, about a streetlight. I do not want to trouble you, but it has become a little bit of a problem for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no trouble. Streetlight out, or flickering, or what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it is not out. It is the opposite. It is very, very bright, and it is also on in the daytime sometimes. But the main thing is the light shines straight into my bedroom window. Every night. I have put a blanket over the curtain, and still it is like a lamp in the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. So it's a bright one, pointed right at you. And you said it's on in the daytime too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T13:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sometimes in the morning, until maybe ten o'clock. And the last few weeks, it has been worse. I am sorry, I am saying a lot. I only want to ask if you can send a crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's what I'm here for. Let me jot this down. Streetlight, too bright, on during the day, shining into a bedroom window, crew to check the pole. Where's the pole at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at my house, one hundred forty-eight Bacheller Street. The pole is right in front, by the edge of the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:00:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One forty-eight Bacheller. That's in the Fifth Ward, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:00:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, exactly, the Fifth Ward. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Does the pole have a number on it, like a little tag or sticker, maybe about eye level?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, one moment, please. [pause] I am sorry, I cannot see from the window. It is dark colored and I do not think I can read from here. I can go outside later, if it is important."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nah, don't worry about it. The address is enough. They'll find it. Is it the only light on your stretch that does that, or are the others the same?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only this one. The others are normal, more yellow. This one is white and very hard. I think maybe it is a new bulb, or something is wrong with the sensor. I do not know the technical word."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sounds like the fixture could be off, or the photocell's bad, which would explain it staying on in the morning. Crew'll look at that. I'll put all of it in the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. You are most generous. [pause] Excuse me one second, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am sorry. A friend came by to visit, he did not tell me he was coming, and now he is waiting in the next room. I do not want to leave him alone for long. So I will try to be quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:01:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally fine. Almost done anyway. Can I get a good callback number in case the crew wants to confirm something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-three. Got it. Declan Lynch, one forty-eight Bacheller."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And, please, do you know about when someone might come? I ask only because I have not slept very well, and honestly it has been going on for a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Light issues like this usually get looked at within a week or two, depending on how the list is. Could be sooner. I'll mark it as a glare complaint so they know it's in a bedroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. A week or two is okay. Only I hope it is not longer than that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it. If nobody's come by then, give us a call back and mention the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do that. Thank you, Kevin. May God give you a good afternoon, and good health to your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:03:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Declan. Take care, and say hi to your friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T14:03:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye, goodbye."
    }
  ],
